95) Ei mu'minon! Dar kh'oli ekh'romi kh'ach'ch'i farz io umra kh'aivonoti khushkigardro makushed. Va kh'ar kas az shumo bark'asd onro bikushad, pas bar vai iake az se ch'azoi zerin peshbini shuda ast: 1. Kh'ar kh'aivoni khushkigardero, ki kushta ast, boiad ainan monandi onro dar ivazi ch'inoiatash k'urboni kunad. Agar shuturro kushta boshad, pas boiad shutur k'urboni kunad. Dar surati kushtani gov io gusfand kh'amin nav'i chorvoro k'urboni kunad. Du mardi adolatpesha az baini musulmonon oidi chorvoi dar ivazi kh'aivoni kushtashuda dovari mekunand, ki oio in chorvo ba kh'aivoni kushtai vai shabokh'at dorad. Zero chorvoe, ki baroi ch'urmi sodirkardaash k'urboni mekunad, boiad shabekh'i kh'aivoni dar kh'oli ekh'rom kushtaash boshad. Vak'te on du mardi odil dar borai on chorvo dovari kardand, pas shakhsi ch'inoiatkarda on kh'aivonro ba monandi chorvoi baroi kh'ach' k'urbonishavanda ba Makka mebarad va dar sarzamini Kh'aram zabkh' mekunad;
2. Io ba andozai k'imati kh'aivoni khushkigardi kushtaash gandum mekharad va onro baroi fak'ironi Kh'aram, ba kh'ar fak'ir ba andozai nim so' tak'sim menamoiad;
3. Io dar badali kh'ar nim so' gandum iak ruz ruza medorad. Mak'sad az ta'iini chunin ch'azo baroi shakhsi ekh'rombastai k'otili saidi khushkigard dar on ast, ki boiad vai ch'azoi ch'inoiatashro bichashad. Allokh' (ch'alla ch'alolukh'u) az on kh'olatkh'oi kushtani saidi sarzamini Kh'aram io k'atli kh'aivonoti shikorii khushkigard, ki pesh az kh'arom shudani in amal az ch'onibi shakhsi ekh'rombasta sodir shuda ast, darguzashta va onro bakhshida ast. Ammo kh'ar kas ba'di kh'arom shudanash boz ba on bargardad, beshak Allokh' (ch'alla ch'alolukh'u) bo uk'ubat az u intik'om megirad va Allokh' (ch'alla ch'alolukh'u) bag'oiat Nerumand ast. Iake az alomatkh'oi nerumandii U on ast, ki agar khokh'ad, az afrodi nofarmon intik'om mesitonad va kh'ech' kas k'udrati peshgirii onro nadorad.
